    "content": "<p>Mark your calendars and prepare your Garages for epic showdowns in <strong>weekly War Robots: Frontiers Community Play Sessions! </strong>Squad up for one hour of mecha-fighting mayhem every Friday &mdash; check <a href=\"https://wr.app/FrontiersDiscord\">Discord</a> Events for your local Play Session time.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xaz2QcYcRys\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/Xaz2QcYcRys?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=8hsgC\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you&#39;re a pro Pilot or just starting your journey, everyone is welcome to join! Feel free to play, watch the stream, or just chat.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Don&rsquo;t miss the Halloween Community Play Session on <strong>October 25 (18:00&ndash;19:00 CEST)</strong>, where participants can earn a <strong>Pumpkin Pilot Sticker. </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2024/10/139-016Live/5.png\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>See you all on the Wild Ten!</p>",
